    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 275,000\n\nThis is a 97 sqm end-of-terraced home in this popular estate on the outskirts of Wexford Town.\nFacing a green area there is ample on-street parking in the immediate vicinity. \nThe accommodation offered is a kitchen/dining area to the front with the living area taking up the entire of the back of the house. This room has direct access to the rear garden which is fenced and offers a patio area, grassed area and a handy utility shed. Also on the ground floor is the guest WC. Upstairs are the family bathroom and three bedrooms, the main bedroom with en-suite.\nMeadow Close is just off Whiterock Hill and is served by a local bus service making all amenities very accessible.\n97 sqm, end of terrace, mains services, broadband, 3 bedroom, 2 bathrooms."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.5m x 1.9m\nwith timber effect vinyl flooring and understair storage\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.3m x 3.3m\nfront-facing room with waist and eye level units, electric hob and oven\n\nLiving Room - 5.3m x 4.1m\nwith open fire and French doors to the garden\n\nGuest WC - 1.9m x 1.9m\ntiled and with WC and WHB\n\nLanding - 3.4m x 1.9m\nwith carpet, skylight and attic hatch\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.9m\ntiled floor and bath surround, WC, WHB, bath with electric shower overhead\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.3m\nrear facing room\n\nHot Press - 1m x 0.8m\nshelved\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.5m x 2.9m\nfront-facing room with laminate flooring and double wardrobe\n\nEn-Suite - 2.5m x 1m\nwith tiled floor and shower surround, WC, WHB and electric shower\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.4m x 2.3m\nsingle bedroom with bulkhead\n\n"
      },
